      "factId": "rearview-mirror-draft-001",
      "topicId": "rearview_mirror",
      "factText": "车内镜与主外后视镜被分成不同类别，法规分别从驾驶者眼点出发规定必须看见的后方路面区域。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-eurlex-un-r46-indirect-vision", "src-eurlex-dir-71-127-rear-view-mirrors"],
      "riskLevel": "safety",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "rearview-mirror-draft-002",
      "topicId": "rearview_mirror",
      "factText": "车内后视镜应能由驾驶者在座位上调整；驾驶侧外后视镜通常也要能在车门关闭时从车内调整。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-eurlex-un-r46-indirect-vision", "src-eurlex-dir-71-127-rear-view-mirrors"],
      "riskLevel": "safety",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "rearview-mirror-draft-003",
      "topicId": "rearview_mirror",
      "factText": "内外后视镜的反射面边缘需要保护壳包覆，法规还用圆角尺寸约束可能与人体接触的突出边缘。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-eurlex-un-r46-indirect-vision", "src-eurlex-dir-71-127-rear-view-mirrors"],
